@startuml ci_pipeline_integration
title T3 7.2 CI Pipeline Integration - Quality Guild CI/CD

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activityBorderColor #333333
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC

start

:GitHub Actions workflow;
note right
Workflow:
.github/workflows/build.yml

Job:
analysis / "Analyze"
end note

:Checkout repository;
note right
Step:
actions/checkout@v6
end note

:Set up .NET;
note right
Step name:
"Set up .NET"

Version:
8.0.x
end note

:Install SonarScanner for .NET;
note right
Step name:
"Install SonarScanner for .NET"
end note

:Prepare native CFamily compile database;
note right
Step name:
"Prepare native CFamily compile database"

Generated artefact path:
ci/sonar/native_compile_commands.json
end note

:Begin SonarQube analysis;
note right
Step name:
"Begin SonarQube analysis"

Key inputs:
SONAR_PROJECT_KEY
SONAR_SOURCE_INCLUSIONS
SONAR_NATIVE_COMPILE_COMMANDS
end note

:Build analysis project;
note right
Step name:
"Build analysis project"

Command:
dotnet build "${SONAR_ANALYSIS_PROJECT}"
end note

:End SonarQube analysis;
note right
Step name:
"End SonarQube analysis"

External quality output:
SonarCloud / SonarQube project dashboard

Current YAML has no upload-artifact step.
end note

stop
@enduml
